Rule 2 (Tensors should have same number of elements or be broadcastable)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1) else ∃k ∈ [0, 0] : k = 0 ∧ (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1]: k = k + shape(v_1, i)) ∧ (∀j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1]: k = k + shape(v_2, j))
